o, cúrcuma, ajo y cebolla en polvo"},{"ingredientId":"aceite-de-oliva","quantity":20,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la salsa de yogur","en":"For the yoghurt sauce"},"note":null,"sourceText":"20 g de aceite de oliva"},{"ingredientId":"pimienta","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la salsa de yogur","en":"For the yoghurt sauce"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Pimienta"},{"ingredientId":"yogur-natural","quantity":1,"unit":"ud","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la salsa de yogur","en":"For the yoghurt sauce"},"note":null,"sourceText":"1 yogur natural"},{"ingredientId":"mostaza-dijon","quantity":0.33,"unit":"tbsp","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la salsa de yogur","en":"For the yoghurt sauce"},"note":null,"sourceText":"1 cucharadita de mostaza Dijon"},{"ingredientId":"miel","quantity":20,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la salsa de yogur","en":"For the yoghurt sauce"},"note":null,"sourceText":"20 g de miel"},{"ingredientId":"sal","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":{"es":"Para la salsa de yogur","en":"For the yoghurt sauce"},"note":null,"sourceText":"Sal"}],"steps":[{"text":{"es":"Marinamos la pechuga de pollo con la cantidad de especias al gusto, un chorrito de limón, aceite y sal, dejamos reposar al menos 1 hora.","en":"Marinate the chicken breast with the spices to taste, a drizzle of lemon juice, oil and salt, and leave to rest for at least 1 hour."},"timerMinutes":60},{"text":{"es":"Ponemos el pollo en una bandeja y cocinamos en la Cecofry a 200ºC durante 14 minutos.","en":"Put the chicken on a tray and cook in the Cecofry at 200 °C for 14 minutes."},"timerMinutes":14,"temperatureC":200},{"text":{"es":"Para el aderezo, batimos todos los ingredientes hasta emulsionar.","en":"For the dressing, whisk all the ingredients until emulsified."}},{"text":{"es":"En una fuente, ponemos una base de canónigos, el mango y el aguacate en dados, el pollo, los cherrys por la mitad, un poco de queso feta, añadimos por encima la salsa de yogur y listo.","en":"On a platter, arrange a base of lamb's lettuce, diced mango and avocado, the chicken, halved cherry tomatoes and a little feta cheese, add the yoghurt sauce on top, and it's ready."}}]}